{"museum":"Q1839461","name":"Plimoth Patuxet Museums","checked":"2026-11-05","source":"Plimoth Patuxet Museums website and OpenStreetMap","onViewKnown":true,"note":"Plimoth Patuxet is a living history museum: what you see are the Historic Patuxet Homesite, the re-created houses of the 17th-Century English Village, Mayflower II and the Grist Mill, with people at work in them. This guide lists those places and the exhibitions now open. Its online catalogue of over 400,000 objects says nothing about what is on view, so collection objects are listed only from the museum’s own teaching pages, as not on view.","works":[{"id":"plimoth-village-street-life","title":"Life in the village, 1627","artist":"17th-Century English Village","medium":"Living history","url":"https://plimoth.org/plan-your-visit/explore-our-sites/17th-century-english-village","imageUrl":"data/plimoth/images/plimoth-village-street-life.jpg","onView":true,"gallery":"English Village","floor":"P"},{"id":"plimoth-village-muster","title":"Muster drill","artist":"17th-Century English Village","medium":"Living history","url":"https://plimoth.org/plan-your-visit/explore-our-sites/17th-century-english-village","imageUrl":"data/plimoth/images/plimoth-village-muster.jpg","onView":true,"gallery":"English Village","floor":"P"},{"id":"plimoth-village-gardens","title":"Kitchen gardens","artist":"17th-Century English Village","medium":"Gardens","url":"https://plimoth.org/plan-your-visit/explore-our-sites/17th-century-english-village","imageUrl":"data/plimoth/images/plimoth-village-gardens.jpg","onView":true,"gallery":"English Village","floor":"P"},{"id":"plimoth-village-games","title":"Pilgrim games","artist":"17th-Century English Village","medium":"Living history","url":"https://plimoth.org/plan-your-visit/explore-our-sites/17th-century-english-village","imageUrl":"data/plimoth/images/plimoth-village-games.jpg","onView":true,"gallery":"English Village","floor":"P"},{"id":"plimoth-homesite-nuhshwetu","title":"Nuhshwetu (